---
<StudioLayout title="Scale to Freedom Path — Strategic Sloth" description="Digital reading on banking, business structures, asset protection, residency, and citizenship." education noindex>
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN / SCALE TO FREEDOM PATH</p><h1>A wider view.<br/>An informed next step.</h1><p class="lede">The complete digital reading package on international business,<br/>banking, residency, and citizenship.</p><div class="hero-actions"><CheckoutLink href={CHECKOUT_URL} price={97} product="scale-to-freedom-path" label="Buy package"/><a class="text-link" href="#included">See what’s included ↓</a></div><p class="small-note">Digital delivery · Self-paced reading · USD · Tax calculated at checkout</p></section>
<section class="section container" id="included"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Inside the package.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/reading-guide/">Compare library packages →</a></div><div class="learning-grid">{includedItems.map(item=><article class="learning-card"><h3>{item.title}</h3>{item.title==='Everything in Best Value Package' && <p>Includes The Freedom Blueprint, Strategic Privacy &amp; Tax Positioning, Residency Without Relocation, Global Business Jurisdictions Guide, and the two starter guides.</p>}</article>)}</div><aside class="learning-note"><strong>Educational reading, at your own pace.</strong><p>This material is not individual legal, tax, financial, or immigration advice. Verify current requirements through official sources and a qualified professional before acting.</p></aside></section>
